Subject: [PATCH v4 22/78] drm/vc4: crtc: Move HVS init and close to a function
Date:   Wed,  8 Jul 2020 19:41:30 +0200
Message-Id: <840cb5324364e431b15d4105c85cebf8d12257f0.1594230107.git-series.maxime@cerno.tech>
